/* IME m16 accumulator types.  Only the LMUL1 / SIGNED / UNSIGNED slots
   are populated -- those are the ones the IME mmacc shape queries via
   `RVV_BASE_lmul1_vector', `RVV_BASE_lmul1_signed_vector', and
   `RVV_BASE_lmul1_unsigned_vector' to resolve the vs1/vs2 operand
   types for `__riscv_vmmacc_vv_*m16'.  The LMUL2 / LMUL4 / LMUL8
   sources (`_lm{N}' variants) route through `ime_lmul_input_idx',
   which has its own m16 mapping -- those slots can stay INVALID
   here.  All other fields are INVALID because m16 types do not
   participate in any standard RVV type-conversion chain (no widen,
   no truncate, no x{N}_vlmul_ext to m32, etc.).  */
